sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DOC as Raw document
    participant PAG as Pagination LLM
    participant GIS as Gisting LLM
    participant MEM as Gist memory
    participant QST as Question
    participant AGT as Agent LLM

    rect rgb(235, 243, 255)
    note over DOC,MEM: Phase 1 - indexing, once per document
    DOC->>PAG: chunks bounded by max_words
    loop until end of document
        PAG->>PAG: choose natural pause tag past min_words
    end
    PAG-->>DOC: semantic episode boundaries
    par each episode, in parallel
        DOC->>GIS: episode text
        GIS->>GIS: shorten, do not summarize
        GIS-->>MEM: gist with page tag
    end
    note over MEM: ordered gist list, 85 to 97 percent smaller
    end

    rect rgb(255, 246, 235)
    note over QST,MEM: Phase 2 - answering, once per question
    QST->>AGT: question, agent sees the gist list only
    loop up to max lookups, sequential mode
        AGT->>MEM: look up Page i
        MEM-->>AGT: raw text of page i
        note over AGT: gist i replaced in place, order preserved
    end
    AGT->>AGT: STOP when it has enough
    AGT-->>QST: answer grounded in the pages it read
    end
